WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.227
Module 10 moves from cleaning to reshaping.

00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:10.137
Once data is trustworthy enough for the task, we often need to change its structure for reporting, comparison,

00:00:10.137 --> 00:00:16.442
or modeling. You will work with analytical grain and wide versus long representations.

00:00:16.442 --> 00:00:23.572
The cleaning principles from Module 9 remain important because reshaping bad or ambiguous data does not fix

00:00:23.572 --> 00:00:29.397
its quality problems. As you move forward, keep the reasoning habits from this module.

00:00:29.397 --> 00:00:35.152
The next topic will add new SQL tools, but it still depends on understanding grain, missing values,

00:00:35.152 --> 00:00:38.466
and the meaning of each transformation.
